WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Your cooperation style sounds fair.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,200
But how can I believe you

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,000
You won't take my gold coins and run away.

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,400
That's why I let you see my talent

5
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,800
if another person betrays

6
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,200
You can also use the secret of talent

7
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,000
Of course, if you are willing to give up your room and become my resident

8
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,200
That's better

9
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,200
I will be good to you and will never squeeze you

10
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,800
do you think it's possible

11
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:19,000
That's it

12
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
You don't even want to be my tenant

13
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Of course I don't want to be your resident either.

14
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,400
Then forget it

15
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,820
You go

16
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:27,020
I won't leave

17
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:30,020
I haven't shown your talent yet.

18
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:32,020
Don't think I'm easy to talk to

19
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:35,590
Don't try to get my gold coins either.

20
00:00:35,590 --> 00:00:37,590
I suggest you consider working with me

21
00:00:37,590 --> 00:00:40,260
Keep your gold coins with me

22
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:42,260
No need to live in fear at all

23
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:46,920
After all, it’s just the first day of time travel

24
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:49,920
I haven't completely given up on my previous moral values.
